diff --git a/CONTRIBUTING.md b/CONTRIBUTING.md
index d4d7fff..e561253 100644
--- a/CONTRIBUTING.md
+++ b/CONTRIBUTING.md
@@ -13,3 +13,7 @@
 
 EPUB metadata includes an `author-sort` field for library sorting. The shared
 normalization step is the one place metadata is reshaped before display.
+Loaders whose format carries `author-sort` (EPUB, FB2) opt in via the base
+`Loader` constructor option `preserveAuthorSort: true`, which keeps the field
+and prefers it as the `sortKey` source; other formats inherit the default
+behavior (derive `sortKey` from `author` and drop `author-sort`).
